# S2 (2026-11-15): two models were named ResultView, so FastAPI published both under
# module-qualified names, and the Python generator dropped four Tests endpoints. The
# Tests one is TestResultView now: the same shape under a new name (checked equal).
POST /runs/{run_id}/make-test added `#/components/schemas/TestResultView` to the `result` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `201`
GET /studio/agents/{agent_id}/tests added `#/components/schemas/TestResultView` to the `cases/items/result` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `200`
POST /studio/agents/{agent_id}/tests added `#/components/schemas/TestResultView` to the `result` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `201`
PUT /studio/agents/{agent_id}/tests/{case_id} added `#/components/schemas/TestResultView` to the `result` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `200`
